## Code Example

```javascript
// Simple guardrail filter: decide if a feature request should be evaluated against guardrails
function shouldGuardrailsApply(request) {
  const highImpactPatterns = [/auth|security|data/i];
  return highImpactPatterns.some((r) => r.test(request.description));
}
```
